  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Outbreak Analytics Approach (IOA) Framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for an integrated outbreak analytics approach (IOA) framework to support public health emergency responses (PHES) in humanitarian settings and crises. Funding will be used to develop an ioa toolkit consisting of an ioa guidance, including associated standard operating procedures (SOPS), IOA tools and existing case studies and animations, all of which will be hosted in an open-source repository.</narrative>
  </description>
